味で資格勉強とかでシチュエーション提示されてそれに対して考える事が出来るのはよい","ts":"1616156839.074000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z53oc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99ae29b4-1765-491d-8ed0-cd33eae1aa8d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"L3のルータもスイッチと言われてしまうので、そこについてはどうしても違和感を感じたりはするw\nけど実際に動かすの大事、とても実感できる。","ts":"1616156795.072700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z4pS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4990c7e9-3f7a-4464-81e2-b697b4760b27","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"一旦はPacketTracerとかでも良いかもだけどやはり実機大事","ts":"1616156687.070500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Chr30"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1D41043F-C910-41D7-B5F8-13644162155E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あとは物理スイッチ触って遊ぶと体感的に覚えられる気がします。","ts":"1616156641.069700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nxm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad8b5f34-ee12-4906-a77b-1f3d7e272f2f","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"infraexpertとてもお世話になった。よいサイト","ts":"1616156572.068900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e13"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bb8ae5f-b9c3-41fe-9682-7e5289f2c428","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"\u003chttps://www.infraexpert.com/study/study19.html\u003e","ts":"1616156509.068100","attachments":[{"fallback":"IPルーティングとは","id":1,"title":"IPルーティングとは","title_link":"https://www.infraexpert.com/study/study19.html","text":"IPルーティングについてはじめから解説します。","blocks":null,"service_name":"infraexpert.com","from_url":"https://www.infraexpert.com/study/study19.html","original_url":"https://www.infraexpert.com/study/study19.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p/MjY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6C6B7E4E-A6DD-43FD-9D92-50A599916033","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ネットワークは授業で習っていなければ、基本情報あたりを勉強するだけでもだいぶ理解力が上がると思います。","ts":"1616156488.068000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U8CC7MDCL"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WBw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6d05225-0d46-4b77-8407-4bb8e2deffc8","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"資格、0次試験があるので受かるかは別として基本情報レベルの勉強はしておくと楽になるのかなぁ。食わず嫌いしてるけどやってみるか...","ts":"1616156205.066100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tm/jc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31f0701e-3844-43ee-bdd6-5efa6c68dc07","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"ipコマンドたしかに。man読んでみたりします","ts":"1616156118.064700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RH/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60e69c6e-fa08-4ee0-969d-e11a05f9ec53","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"`ip route` の結果とそれの見方とか付随する単語の意味を調べると良さそう。\nそもそもルーティングなんで必要なのとか\nこのへんの話どうなんでしょうね。実務に放りこまれて覚えた人が大半じゃないですかね。\n資格勉強するとかよいのかもしれない。","ts":"1616156037.064100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8uw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1cc3d7db-8c09-44d1-b995-9ae551f9ddaa","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"ルートテーブルが一番ピンと来てないですね...\nなんでだろう。この辺の基礎になるようなところをどうやって身につければいいのかもわからないな","ts":"1616155414.058500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fp3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"385ec562-bb55-4ca5-a9b7-e2bc0664fb49","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"それですね。\nルートテーブル/ENIあたりのはぱっと見載ってなかった…\nサブネットはAZって物理的に違うロケーションにあるデータセンタの事って考えるとなんで切る必要があるか理解しやすいと思います。\nルートテーブルは別CIDRで複数VPCとか立ててその間で通信したいみたいなシチュが分かりやすそう。\nENIは普通にデスクトップPCとかにあるNICを想像してもらえばいいと思いますが、コンソールに表示されないAWSが使ってるIPとかあったりするのがちょっと面倒かもしれない。。。\n(/24切ったからって254個フルに使える訳じゃないとか)","ts":"1616155233.056800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kmw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a893c1cc-3068-4911-81e7-a2f15c69d22e","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"\u003chttps://docs.aws.amazon.com/quickstart/latest/vpc/images/quickstart-vpc-design-fullscreen.png\u003e\nこれか、ありがとうございます。","ts":"1616154705.050200","attachments":[{"fallback":"2034x1300px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quickstart/latest/vpc/images/quickstart-vpc-design-fullscreen.png","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quickstart/latest/vpc/images/quickstart-vpc-design-fullscreen.png","original_url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quickstart/latest/vpc/images/quickstart-vpc-design-fullscreen.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jhY3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fef8520-55bd-45d9-b6b2-b5bfc90dcb06","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"サブネット、ルートテーブル、ネットワークインターフェースあたりすね。","ts":"1616154641.049800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9G8+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9597479-6cb9-4534-b67a-0961a3276cbd","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"AWSが用意してるVPCアーキテクチャかなんかの図がぼちぼち分かりやすかった気がします。\n依存関係っていうとAZ/VPC/サブネットとかそういうのかしら","ts":"1616154584.049100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fXU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"481a30d1-35e5-407c-8560-1e405803808f","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"AWSのネットワークわからなさすぎる...依存関係とかそのへんごちゃごちゃです","ts":"1616142794.047700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block